ssionDenied before ShareLinkSerializer.create can create the share link (src-baa9e644e5441f97:2873-2886; src-baa9e644e5441f97:2869-2871). Thus global view_document is an additional required global gate in the validator, but it does not substitute for the owner-aware object check. The supplied serializer crop does not include the field declaration or generic create dispatch, so those mechanics are not independently claimed; the supplied validation hook is nevertheless the decisive control, and the premise supplies the referenced existing document received by it.","facts":[{"id":"f-entry","kind":"entry","statement":"ShareLinkViewSet is the supplied entry viewset for share-link operations and uses ShareLinkSerializer.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-64b8926d5eb16fbb","startLine":4696,"endLine":4708}]},{"id":"f-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The viewset declares IsAuthenticated and PaperlessObjectPermissions as its permission classes.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-64b8926d5eb16fbb","startLine":4708,"endLine":4710}]},{"id":"f-create-auth","kind":"control","statement":"PaperlessObjectPermissions maps POST to the model add permission, so the view-level creation check concerns add_sharelink for the ShareLink object.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-81f6400744c9c9e9","startLine":30,"endLine":43}]},{"id":"f-resource","kind":"binding","statement":"ShareLinkSerializer exposes document as the referenced ShareLink field, and its document validator receives the resolved document.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-baa9e644e5441f97","startLine":2851,"endLine":2867},{"sourceId":"src-baa9e644e5441f97","startLine":2873,"endLine":2881}]},{"id":"f-target-control","kind":"control","statement":"Document validation requires global documents.view_document and a successful owner-aware view_document check on the document.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-baa9e644e5441f97","startLine":2873,"endLine":2882}]},{"id":"f-owner-aware","kind":"condition","statement":"For an owned document not owned by the caller, the owner-aware helper delegates to the object permission checker; only an owner, an unowned object, or a successful object permission check passes.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-81f6400744c9c9e9","startLine":624,"endLine":635}]},{"id":"f-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"If document validation fails, the serializer raises PermissionDenied; serializer creation that assigns a slug and delegates to object creation is not reached.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-baa9e644e5441f97","startLine":2869,"endLine":2871},{"sourceId":"src-baa9e644e5441f97","startLine":2873,"endLine":2886}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":10220,"output":1266,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":72875.7696,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-28T18:19:43.022Z"}}
